# CLAUDE.md (Solo XP operation template)

Each skill in the Solo XP framework (`xp_Director` / `xp_Architect` / `xp_Tester` / `xp_Implementer` / `xp_Auditor` / `xp_Documenter` / `xp_Reviewer` / `xp_worklog`, etc.) is located in `CLAUDE.md` in the repository root. It operates on the assumption that the following contents exist. **Copy and paste this entire file into your repository's `CLAUDE.md` (or at the end of an existing `CLAUDE.md`), filling in the `<...>` placeholders as appropriate for your project.**

Without this file, the skill side will not be able to refer to judgment criteria such as branch operation, whether to issue a PR, TDD principles, work time records, and operation confirmation procedures, resulting in unintended behavior (e.g., a confirmation is required each time a PR is issued/parent branch operation does not function).

## Which sections are needed for which skills?

| Section | Prerequisite skills |
|---|---|
| Branch operation / User pre-approval for PR issuance | xp_Director, xp_Architect, xp_Auditor |
| Issue/PR Workflow | xp_Director |
| TDD development principles | xp_Tester, xp_Implementer |
| Work time recording rules | xp_worklog |
| Operation confirmation/preview environment | xp_RunTestSuites, xp_RunE2ETests |

